@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Facade — checkout hai bước
class CheckoutController {
 +prepare()
+confirm()
+cancel()
}
class CheckoutFacade {
 +prepare(actor,key,items,correlationId)
+confirm(id,actor,key,request,correlationId)
+cancel(id,actor,correlationId)
}
class InvoiceService {
 +prepare(...)
+cancel(...)
}
class PaymentService {
 +confirm(...)
}
class CheckoutOrchestrator {
 +advance(id,correlationId)
}
CheckoutController --> CheckoutFacade
CheckoutFacade --> InvoiceService
CheckoutFacade --> PaymentService
CheckoutFacade --> CheckoutOrchestrator
note bottom of CheckoutFacade
Facade cung cấp API gọn cho Controller.
Domain rules ở Builder/Strategy; persistence ở repository;
Saga chi tiết trong CheckoutOrchestrator.
end note
@enduml
